arw_v3.pdf: A description of the Advanced Research WRF Version 3, 
    http://www2.mmm.ucar.edu/wrf/users/docs/arw_v3.pdf

Emission_guide.pdf: WRF-Chem Emissions Guide, 
    http://ruc.noaa.gov/wrf/wrf-chem/Emission_guide.pdf

